description=Shared room/building Stock targets, paper/PC reports and PC-only low-stock alerts. Latest-per-area multi-CD/Base Ledger prefers connected loaded local-copy PCs and uses a completed carried CD for dated offline history. Requires paired PC Framework 0.11.0-dev.1 APIs and current permissions. MP testing candidate; native SP/dedicated acceptance pending. Requires B47ANCEDUI client API 1 (Workshop 3822582242) for shared presentation; paired offline with UI 0.5.0-dev.11. Container sorting, physical shopping lists, Dibs! supply goals and paper/CD inventory ledgers. Requires B47ANCEDRooms (Workshop 3820077442) and B47ANCEDPCFramework (Workshop 3822042011) on the server and every client. Designated rooms come from Rooms; buildings use native PZ scope. Configure categories/items, priorities, presets and Whole Container inheritance. Sort supports eligible carried, stationary, floor/proximity and selected vehicle storage through native transfers. SortUpdatesLedger is enabled by default: carry a pen/pencil; accessible loaded building storage is searched first for a completed covering ledger, otherwise use a carried blank/unfinished Supply Sheet. After the whole successful Sort, confirmed touched storage is written to the paper. New supply ledgers consume one whole Notebook and retain the clipboard/writer. Disabling SortUpdatesLedger restores the earlier Sort requirements; Disabled Ledger mode bypasses ledger requirements. Shopping collection requires fresh location knowledge by default; planning remains available. Physical Shopping Lists use a separate blank sheet and retain notebook/writer. Install the found Quartermaster Application CD on each powered PC before digital ledger use; the reusable setup CD is released after install and need not remain nearby. Computer live updates apply only to the exact building recorded by the ledger. Vanilla categories alone; optional Better Sorting, Better Containers or Extended Categories use supported native category contracts. Disable original Quartermaster and older B47 copies. Current capabilities: Movement 12 / Ledger 5 / Rooms 4 / Shopping 3 / Personal 2; use matching builds and reconnect. MP testing build - dedicated multiplayer NOT TESTED. Lua-only; no custom Java. Native transfer, permission and capacity limits still apply. Advisory allocation enforcement/live role routing remain disabled.
